  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM response in Ukraina and neighbour countries, earmarked Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to IOM under the UN humanitarian appeal for Ukraina and neighbour countries. NOK 12 million is softly earmarked for human trafficking in Moldova. A major flow of refugees and migrants towards neighbouring countries requiere humanitarian border management support, including in the field of health and shelter. Thematic focus in Neighbouring Countries: Refugees, housing, emergency food items, water and sanitation, protection, health, cash, food security, SGBV and human trafficking</narrative>
  </description>
